{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1340499-the-power-of-totem-ibis","id":1340499,"title":"The power of totem Ibis","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-09T14:19:41-07:00","id":1340499,"title":"The power of totem Ibis","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> I'd like to ask for your ideas. One Pack (Silent Strider oriented) wants to choose totem Ibis, but before they spend tons of backgrounds, they inquire about the possible use of it's Trait.<br /> First, my reaction was: Of f*ck!<br /> <br /> &quot;A child of Ibis can ask after any specific memory recorded from any child of Ibis, living or dead...&quot;<br /> <br /> What are those memories? What they can be? A tomb of an ancient vampire? An almost forgotten Ritual? Treasure trove? The receipt of an egyiptian bear? The system of a dead language? The face of Set? Really bad 6000 year old poetry? <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T16:42:52-07:00","id":1340516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lachdanan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1340499-the-power-of-totem-ibis#post1340499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello,<br /> <br /> I'd like to ask for your ideas. One Pack (Silent Strider oriented) wants to choose totem Ibis, but before they spend tons of backgrounds, they inquire about the possible use of it's Trait.<br /> First, my reaction was: Of f*ck!<br /> <br /> &quot;A child of Ibis can ask after any specific memory recorded from any child of Ibis, living or dead...&quot;<br /> <br /> What are those memories? What they can be? A tomb of an ancient vampire? An almost forgotten Ritual? Treasure trove? The receipt of an egyiptian bear? The system of a dead language? The face of Set? Really bad 6000 year old poetry?</div> </div> </div> </div>Run it like Wisdom of ANcient ways but refluffed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T17:56:06-07:00","id":1340524,"title":"","content":"I would require them to know what they are asking about. I want the memory of THIS specific thing from THIS specific Garou who has/had the totem of Ibis. They have to know what they are asking for. They can't just say they want some kind of memory involving generic description from any potential child of Ibis. That means they have to know that this specific child of Ibis had this particular event in their lives. <br /> <br /> So that gives you complete control over what they can get. It will mean some more work for you as an ST to determine what could potentially be known to the PCs. So if they want to know anything other than what the PCs in this pack actually experienced, they better be finding OTHER packs dedicated to Ibis either among their contemporaries, retired Garou of older packs, or somehow researching the historical records of packs long gone. I don't know how they'd get that information, but they could certainly try along with some preparation by you beforehand. But let's face it, lots of potential memories are probably not accessible to them (unless of course, one of them could access a past child of Ibis through their Ancestors ability). <br /> <br /> But this would be a good way for you to build a network of NPC Garou that all want to connect with each other because what packs of Ibis exist would likely WANT to meet one another and hear what each other knows. And that means Galliards (and others) of those packs probably have a LOT of oral lore and written down journals where they record this information in order to help themselves and their brethren packs access needed information.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, in terms of what constitutes a &quot;memory&quot; - I'd use what is found in the totem description earlier: any sight, sound, message, or sent that can be recalled. How &quot;long&quot; that memory could be is up to you - but I'd probably limit it to no more than a short scene. Probably under 5 minutes, but I might be willing to extend that memory if the PC expends Willpower. So while they could recall seeing a tomb of an ancient vampire, that doesn't mean they know how to find it based on that alone. But it could provide them more information that could be combined with other clues they've gathered to help them find it.<br /> <br /> It is not Ancestors - so you don't get abilities of any kind. So they don't learn forgotten languages, entire books, etc. They don't get any additional understanding they don't already possess. So while they might observe a Rite, they don't know it nor do they get bonuses to Rituals. Whether that memory constitutes &quot;partaking&quot; of a rite to allow them to do so at +3 difficulty, is up to you as ST.<br /> <br /> So if they want to &quot;remember&quot; what a particular child of Ibis said in 2000 BC outside Memphis, Egypt, they already better be able to understand ancient Egyptian. But once they do get that memory, they could always write it down phonetically to translate later, or repeat it to someone who could translate for them. Likewise, they probably wouldn't know how to read that wall of Egyptian hieroglyphs they saw - but they could write it down so someone who does know could translate for them.<br /> <br /> That's how I'd run based on first thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T22:50:51-07:00","id":1340738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1340499-the-power-of-totem-ibis?p=1340524#post1340524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But this would be a good way for you to build a network of NPC Garou that all want to connect with each other because what packs of Ibis exist would likely WANT to meet one another and hear what each other knows. And that means Galliards (and others) of those packs probably have a LOT of oral lore and written down journals where they record this information in order to help themselves and their brethren packs access needed information.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's actually a very good idea. Intresting, that thay may be able to communicate through recorded memories &amp; I haven't thought about it.<br /> <br /> <br /> We already have a system, how to &quot;remember correctly&quot;. I find &quot;THIS specific thing from THIS specific Garou&quot; a little bit too harsh. Ibis want's to preserve knowledge, but this would do it (en masse) almost unavaiable. No one knows, Mr. Genereic Strider from 4000 year earlier.<br /> <br /> But yeah, clear, that it would not give knowledges, just memories.<br /> <br /> A question like &quot;Where vamps. live?&quot; would be too generic, but &quot;In which necropolis was Sou-Hak-Hotep, the scourge of Moon was buried?&quot; could be more usefull.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T23:57:54-07:00","id":1340745,"title":"","content":"Whatever works for your group. In general, the thing is to have something be useful for your particular playing group, but not overpowered. And there is always going to be a range on that between different player groups.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}